            <strong>AI Mode is an add-on, not an endpoint.</strong> You buy it by sending <code>include_ai_mode=true</code> with a Deep Search call on a paid plan, and the $0.004 is charged on top of that call's own rate &mdash; a 10-page Deep call at Default is $0.006 for the pages plus $0.004 for AI Mode. It is priced the same at every tier because it is a flat fee per call, not a rate we discount.
