      <p class="section-subtitle">Concurrency, minute/hour limits and queue priority follow your <strong>live spendable balance</strong>, separately from the price schedule on each credit balance. Spending down can lower those limits. Daily allowance is at least 10,000 requests/day for every account, including free accounts, or 100,000/day after verified total net deposits of $500; higher balance bands keep their higher daily limits. Goodwill and bonus credit do not count; refunds and chargebacks reduce qualifying deposits. Reviewed custom daily allocations take precedence.</p>
